{"id":47585,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47585"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:14:55","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:14:55","slug":"maratona-de-macau","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-macau\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona Internacional de Macau 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona Internacional de Macau 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Maratona Internacional de Macau 2026<\/strong> (45\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da *Galaxy Entertainment Maratona Internacional de Macau*) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Centro Desportivo Ol\u00edmpico \u2013 Est\u00e1dio<\/strong>, na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Taipa, Macau<\/strong>. Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o dos atletas \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">05:00<\/strong>, tiro de partida da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Maratona e Meia Maratona \u00e0s 06:00<\/strong> e da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Maratona \u00e0s 06:20<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica asi\u00e1tica com ra\u00edzes lus\u00f3fonas re\u00fane <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">12.000 corredores<\/strong> de todo o mundo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso \u00e9 certificado oficialmente pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">AIMS<\/strong> segundo os regulamentos da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">World Athletics<\/strong>, cruzando a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pen\u00ednsula de Macau<\/strong>, a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Taipa<\/strong> e o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Cotai<\/strong>, com passagem junto a marcos hist\u00f3ricos do patrim\u00f3nio luso-chin\u00eas como o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Templo de A-M\u00e1<\/strong>, a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ponte Governador Nobre de Carvalho<\/strong> e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ponte de Sai Van<\/strong>. O evento integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias: a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Maratona (42,195 km, limite de 6 horas)<\/strong>, a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Meia Maratona (21,0975 km, limite de 3 horas)<\/strong> e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Maratona (cerca de 5 km, limite de 1h15)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada conjuntamente pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Instituto do Desporto do Governo da RAEM<\/strong>, pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Galaxy Entertainment Group<\/strong> e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Geral de Atletismo de Macau (AGAM)<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza postos de \u00e1gua, isot\u00f3nico e esponjas a cada 2,5 km, chuveiros de arrefecimento no percurso, medalha *finisher* e certificado oficial para todos os atletas que cortem a meta dentro do tempo regulamentar. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" st